              <td>Commuters traveling frequently across Lahore</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Sector H</strong></td>
              <td>1 Kanal</td>
              <td>88% Built</td>
              <td>Peaceful residential enclave, sports grounds</td>
              <td>Long-term capital holders and quiet living</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Sector J</strong></td>
              <td>10 Marla, 1 Kanal</td>
              <td>95% Built</td>
              <td>Beaconhouse Campus, vibrant commercial lanes</td>
              <td>Mid-to-large families seeking 10 Marla villas</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Sector K</strong></td>
              <td>10 Marla, 1 Kanal</td>
              <td>88% Built</td>
              <td>Sector K Community Park, affordable plots</td>
              <td>Value-oriented home builders and investors</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Sector L</strong></td>
              <td>10 Marla, 1 Kanal</td>
              <td>85% Built</td>
              <td>Direct Ring Road & Barki Road exit</td>
              <td>Fast-turnover plots and high rental demand</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Sector M</strong></td>
              <td>10 Marla, 1 Kanal, Raya Villas</td>
              <td>90% Built</td>
              <td>Integrated with Defence Raya Golf Course</td>
              <td>Elite golf lifestyle and luxury investors</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Sector N</strong></td>
              <td>1 Kanal, 2 Kanal, Golf Villas</td>
              <td>88% Built</td>
              <td>Raya Fairways Commercial & Clubhouse</td>
              <td>High-net-worth individuals & diplomats</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>CCA 1 & CCA 2</strong></td>
              <td>4 Marla, 8 Marla Commercial</td>
              <td>100% Commercial</td>
              <td>Banking rows, designer restaurants, supermarkets</td>
              <td>Commercial landlords, retail brands, corporate offices</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4: BEST SECTORS TO LIVE -->
    <section id="best-to-live" class="guide-section">
      <div class="section-tag">Section 4</div>
      <h2>4. Best Sectors to Live in DHA Phase 6 Lahore</h2>
      <p>
        Choosing the ideal residential sector in DHA Phase 6 depends on household lifestyle needs, family structure, and personal priorities:
      </p>
      <div class="cards-grid-3">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🏡</div>
          <h3>Sector C & D: Central Elite Living</h3>
          <p>
            Widely regarded as the golden core of Phase 6. Sector C boasts the architectural masterpiece Grand Jamia Masjid and expansive community recreation parks, while Sector D borders CCA 1 for effortless dining, grocery shopping, and banking without vehicle dependency.
          </p>
          <a href="/dha-phase-6-sector-c-lahore/" class="card-link">Explore Sector C Guide →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🎓</div>
          <h3>Sector J & B: Academic Excellence</h3>
          <p>
            For parents with school-going children, Sectors J and B are unparalleled. Housing Beaconhouse, Roots Millennium, and top grammar preschools, children can commute within 2 to 3 minutes, entirely avoiding peak regional arterial traffic.
          </p>
          <a href="/dha-phase-6-sector-j-lahore/" class="card-link">Explore Sector J Guide →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⛳</div>
          <h3>Defence Raya (M & N): Resort Lifestyle</h3>
          <p>
            Offering scenic fairways, controlled perimeter security, golf-view villas, and private clubhouse memberships. Ideal for affluent executives, overseas Pakistanis, and retirees seeking world-class serenity and manicured greenery.
          </p>
          <a href="/dha-phase-6-defence-raya-lahore/" class="card-link">Explore Defence Raya →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 5: BEST SECTORS FOR INVESTMENT -->
    <section id="best-investment" class="guide-section">
      <div class="section-tag">Section 5</div>
      <h2>5. Best Sectors for Investment & Capital Growth</h2>
      <p>
        Real estate investors in DHA Phase 6 generally divide capital across two distinct strategies: high-yielding commercial assets or high-appreciation residential land parcels:
      </p>
      <div class="investment-pillars">
        <div class="pillar-box">
          <h3>Commercial Plazas (CCA 1, CCA 2, Main Boulevard)</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Rental Yields:</strong> 6.5% to 8.0% annually, backed by triple-net leases from multinational corporate tenants and premier banking franchises.</li>
            <li><strong>Capital Velocity:</strong> Sustained high transaction liquidity due to finite commercial zoning quotas within DHA Phase 6.</li>
            <li><strong>Recommended Sizes:</strong> 4 Marla (Basement + Ground + 3 Floors) and 8 Marla corner plazas.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar-box">
          <h3>Residential Infill Plots (Sectors K, L, and G)</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Price Appreciation Runway:</strong> While Sectors A, B, and C are near-saturation, Sectors K, L, and G offer competitive price entry points with significant upside as construction accelerates.</li>
            <li><strong>Ring Road Connectivity:</strong> Sector G and L benefit directly from immediate interchange exits, attracting tenants commuting across Lahore.</li>
            <li><strong>Recommended Sizes:</strong> 10 Marla and 1 Kanal residential plots.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 6: PROPERTY PRICE TRENDS -->
    <section id="price-trends" class="guide-section">
      <div class="section-tag">Section 6</div>
      <h2>6. Comprehensive Property Price Trends (2025–2026)</h2>
      <p>
        Below is the verified price benchmark reflecting genuine market asking demands across DHA Phase 6 Lahore:
      </p>

      <div class="price-table-wrapper">
        <table class="data-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Property Category</th>
              <th>Dimensions</th>
              <th>Plot Price Range (PKR)</th>
              <th>New House Price (PKR)</th>
              <th>Average Monthly Rent (PKR)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>5 Marla Residential</strong></td>
              <td>25 × 45 ft (125 sq yds)</td>
              <td>1.35 Cr – 1.95 Cr</td>
              <td>2.75 Cr – 3.80 Cr</td>
              <td>85,000 – 130,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>10 Marla Residential</strong></td>
              <td>35 × 65 ft (250 sq yds)</td>
              <td>2.60 Cr – 3.90 Cr</td>
              <td>4.50 Cr – 7.20 Cr</td>
              <td>160,000 – 260,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>1 Kanal Residential</strong></td>
              <td>50 × 90 ft (500 sq yds)</td>
