              <td>8.50 Cr – 13.50 Cr</td>
              <td>320,000 – 550,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>2 Kanal Residential</strong></td>
              <td>75 × 120 ft (1,000 sq yds)</td>
