              <td>18.0 Cr – 28.0+ Cr</td>
              <td>650,000 – 1,100,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>4 Marla Commercial</strong></td>
              <td>30 × 30 ft (100 sq yds)</td>
              <td>7.50 Cr – 14.0 Cr</td>
