        *Data compiled from verified public listings, transaction records, and independent valuation benchmarks. Actual values vary based on corner location, park frontage, and boulevard exposure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 7: SCHOOLS & EDUCATION -->
    <section id="education" class="guide-section">
      <div class="section-tag">Section 7</div>
      <h2>7. World-Class Educational Infrastructure</h2>
      <p>
        DHA Phase 6 hosts an exceptional academic ecosystem catering to early childhood development, Cambridge O/A Levels, and international undergraduate curricula:
      </p>
      <div class="amenity-highlight-grid">
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <h4>Beaconhouse School System</h4>
          <p>Situated along Sector J's primary educational avenue, providing Cambridge primary and middle schooling with Olympic swimming facilities and football grounds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <h4>Lahore Grammar School (LGS)</h4>
          <p>World-renowned academic faculty delivering premier O & A Level programs with advanced robotics labs and debate societies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <h4>SICAS (Sector D & J Corridor)</h4>
          <p>State-of-the-art campus renowned for holistic extracurricular training, competitive arts, and foreign university placement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <h4>Roots Millennium School</h4>
          <p>Sector B campus offering international baccalaureate pathways, language immersion, and advanced STEM coursework.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>
        <a href="/properties-near-schools-dha-phase-6-lahore/" class="text-link">Explore properties available near Phase 6 schools →</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 8: HEALTHCARE FACILITIES -->
    <section id="healthcare" class="guide-section">
      <div class="section-tag">Section 8</div>
      <h2>8. Healthcare & Emergency Medical Network</h2>
      <p>
        Residents of Phase 6 benefit from rapid emergency and diagnostic healthcare within 3 to 7 minutes from any residential gate:
      </p>
      <div class="amenity-highlight-grid">
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <h4>DHA Medical Centre (Sector E)</h4>
          <p>Primary multi-specialty polyclinic with 24/7 emergency trauma, pediatric care, digital radiography, and on-site pharmacy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <h4>PKLI (Pakistan Kidney & Liver Institute)</h4>
          <p>Situated immediately across Ring Road, PKLI is South Asia's premier quaternary research hospital and transplant center.</p>
